  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expert support to CERF energy transition niches</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supports the implementation of the Climate and Energy Response Facility (CERF) by providing Dutch expertise on key energy transition niches, particularly offshore wind, hydrogen and solar energy. It contributes to CERF strategies, supports embassies in priority countries and connects Dutch knowledge and companies to international climate cooperation opportunities.The activity also includes expert contributions to international events and thematic coordination, including engagement in the World Hydrogen Summit and the Hydrogen for Development partnership.RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country has been included in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
